Historical bounded experiments have a Bend2 2.0.35 compiler lineage at commit
11d483271b46e445b922756d5fd4127a1ea99ae8. That compiler is not the active
general-backend compiler.

Rust and GLSL primitive drafts generated using verified free OpenCode
space-bunny-free, then reviewed and checked locally. Any local corrections
are listed in evidence/VALIDATION.md. This is not an upstream-supported
backend and is not a proof checker. The original adapter handled a checked scalar
U32 segment. The general backend added later lowers the pinned compiler's
device C runtime to Vulkan while retaining upstream attribution and licensing.
